---
title: Export PDF to PDF/A for archiving
description: Create a PDF/A-ready archival file — flatten, clean metadata, mark conformance.
relatedTool: pdf-to-pdfa
---

PDF/A is designed for long-term storage. WeLovePDF exports a **PDF/A-ready** file in your browser.

## Steps

1. Open **PDF to PDF/A**.
2. Upload your document.
3. Choose PDF/A-2b (recommended) or PDF/A-1b.
4. Keep **Flatten forms** enabled, then export and download.

## Tips

> **Important:** Browser export is best-effort. Validate with a PDF/A preflight tool before formal archival submission.

